Package: com.mbucc9000.groupsearch
Name: GroupSearch
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Type a group chat's name in the To: field of a new message and the group shows up in the suggestions. Tap it to add everyone in it. Uses names from GroupChatNameFix.
